==Known Bugs==
*Evolution IV Prelude of Might does not reflect the added critical multiplier in the stats screen when it previously did.
*{{Weapon|Braton Prime}} Incarnon Form
**{{M|Galvanized Aptitude}} ignores the base damage value of both Evolution II perks.
*Evolution II's Multishot bonus is displayed at twice its value for the Incarnon mode in the arsenal, showing '''+40%''' Multishot, while still only granting '''+20%'''.

